 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "You'd never lose a week of mornings to one word.",
   "rate": "+14%",
   "pitch": "-6Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "These two did.",
   "rate": "+6%",
   "pitch": "-7Hz",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Arjun drives to the tech park. Kabir, his new neighbour, works there too. No car.",
   "rate": "+28%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "So Arjun texts him. Pick you up at the gate, eight sharp.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Monday. Arjun waits at the gate. Kabir waits at the gate. Nobody comes.",
   "rate": "+28%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Tuesday. Twenty minutes each. Still nobody.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "-3Hz",
   "gap": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Wednesday, they both text, I am literally at the gate.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+6Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "And they were both telling the truth.",
   "rate": "+12%",
   "pitch": "-5Hz",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "This colony has two gates.",
   "rate": "+4%",
   "pitch": "-8Hz",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Front gate. Back gate. Two hundred metres apart.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "The guard? He figured it out on Monday.",
   "rate": "+18%",
   "pitch": "-3Hz",
   "gap": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody asked him.",
   "rate": "+6%",
   "pitch": "-8Hz",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Thursday, both of them walk over to the other gate.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Different paths. Perfect swap.",
   "rate": "+16%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Lesson: the gate is not a place.",
   "rate": "+10%",
   "pitch": "-6Hz",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "So the pickup moved into an app.",
   "rate": "+22%",
   "pitch": "+4Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Kabir taps, I'm at the pickup point. One spot.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "And Arjun's car crawls closer on the map.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Friday. One car. One gate. Zero waiting.",
   "rate": "+18%",
   "pitch": "-2Hz",
   "gap": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "And the guard? Now they ask him first.",
   "rate": "+20%",
   "pitch": "+6Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Their pickup point? Neither gate. The chai stall in the middle.",
   "rate": "+18%",
   "pitch": "-3Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "If meet me at the gate ruined your morning, try Sahyatri.",
   "rate": "+18%",
   "pitch": "-2Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Link in bio.",
